# Files uploaded to the build but never used by it. Everything the site serves
# is already under public/ or src/.

# Image and video masters, ~40 MB. The delivered WebP and MP4 are derived from
# these and committed under public/; the masters exist only for a re-encode.
source-assets

# Design documentation, read by people rather than the build.
Design Reference
design-system

# Build-time artwork tooling. Needs an OpenRouter key that no longer exists in
# the environment, and is never invoked by `next build`.
scripts

# Local caches and secrets. `.env*` is also in .gitignore; naming it here as
# well means a stray local file cannot ride along in a CLI deploy.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
.next
node_modules
